WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.036
Two models. But how many retrieval routes?

00:00:30.036 --> 00:01:07.619
Different representations can preserve different clues

00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:37.362
Two lists supply overlapping candidate sets

00:01:37.362 --> 00:02:03.000
One route can support several later stages

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:37.544
Multiple routes can feed one scoring stage

00:02:37.544 --> 00:03:12.022
Parallel retrieval can feed a later reranker

00:03:12.022 --> 00:03:39.203
Choosing routes is a separate decision

00:03:39.203 --> 00:04:13.800
Ask what the hybrid label leaves unanswered
